    prov:wasGeneratedBy sub:extraction .

  sub:quote a prov:Entity ;
    schema:text "But the much greater variability, as well as the greater frequency of monstrosities, under domestication or cultivation, than under nature, leads me to believe that deviations of structure are in some way due to the nature of the conditions of life, to which the parents and their more remote ancestors have been exposed during several generations." ;
